--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The types below reproduce behaviour described in DeepEval's source rather than
values reproduced from its tests, because at the commit above no such values
exist. The tests for the four trace-level metrics skip when OPENAI_API_KEY is
unset, run a live agent, and assert only that the golden is not multimodal; the
two tool metrics have no test file. Each type names the source file it was read
from, and each is exercised by a test that fixes this kit's own behaviour.

  io.akka.evalkit.metric.ToolCorrectness
      from ToolCorrectnessMetric
      deepeval/metrics/tool_correctness/tool_correctness.py

  io.akka.evalkit.metric.ArgumentCorrectness
      from ArgumentCorrectnessMetric
      deepeval/metrics/argument_correctness/argument_correctness.py

  io.akka.evalkit.metric.TaskCompletion
      from TaskCompletionMetric
