--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Deliberate divergences
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

One behaviour differs from upstream on purpose. A score recorded by this kit is
not comparable with a score recorded by DeepEval for a run that hit it.

1. A run with nothing to read is not a passing score.

   PlanQualityMetric and PlanAdherenceMetric score 1 and pass when a trace
   carries no plan. ToolCorrectnessMetric scores 1 when no tools were expected
   and none were called. ArgumentCorrectnessMetric scores 1 when there were no
   tool calls to judge. Here PlanQuality, PlanAdherence, StepEfficiency and
   ArgumentCorrectness return RunOutcome.Unscoreable for those runs, which keeps
   them out of the pass rate rather than counting them toward it.

ToolCorrectness also omits upstream's tool-selection score, which takes the lower
of the deterministic score and a model's opinion of whether better tools were
available. That question is TaskCompletion's here.
